  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e4dd14f3b6be758",
      "translationZh": "2026年8月12日，阿里巴巴的Qwen团队发布了Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B。这是Qwen-Max级别模型首次以开放权重形式提供。该模型拥有2.4万亿总参数（每个token激活950亿参数），采用混合线性加全注意力架构，原生上下文长度高达262K tokens（可扩展至1M）。Qwen3.8旨在应对最具挑战性的智能体和推理工作负载，包括多步编码、长程规划和自主工具使用。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "666f6c63e89aba19",
      "translationZh": "开放权重模型赋予您完全的控制权。数据保留在您的基础设施内部，推理行为可以进行定制，并且在大规模部署时没有按令牌计算的 API 费用。其权衡在于运维方面：托管一个 2.4T 参数的模型需要专用的 GPU 基础设施和优化的服务栈。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfad8e49044c2e64",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们展示了如何在 Amazon SageMaker HyperPod 上使用 vLLM 在 ml.p6-b300 实例（配备 8 块 NVIDIA B300 Blackwell Ultra GPU）上部署 Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B。我们涵盖了从集群配置到 OpenAI 兼容端点的完整流程，包括针对 NVFP4 量化、内置推理、工具调用以及原生多令牌预测（MTP）投机解码的 vLLM 配置。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4fd253a53db271c",
      "translationZh": "这是我们在 Amazon SageMaker HyperPod 上部署开放万亿参数模型系列文章的第二篇。关于涵盖 Kimi K3 的第一篇文章，请参阅《在 Amazon SageMaker HyperPod 和 Amazon EKS 上部署 Kimi K3》。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9757c88f3a55a59f",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B 概览",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5503f9f66ed47274",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B（Qwen3.8-Max 的开放权重版本）是 Qwen 系列中规模最大、能力最强的模型。以下是与部署相关的关键架构细节摘要。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c70340519347cd12",
      "translationZh": "每个令牌激活的参数",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65fc44328d8c4612",
      "translationZh": "细粒度混合专家（MoE）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f681da7464cc8b0b",
      "translationZh": "512 个路由专家 + 1 个共享专家（每个 token 激活 10 个路由专家）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4921f71f69dde41c",
      "translationZh": "3 × (门控 DeltaNet → MoE) → 1 × (门控注意力 → MoE)，重复",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d060db68d417301",
      "translationZh": "原生支持 262,144 个 token。可扩展至 1,010,000 个 token。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a40b163d8603c8aa",
      "translationZh": "原生 MTP 草稿头（无需独立模型即可启用推测解码）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    }
  ],
